	"title"		"Anthony Algorithm - Relics (东尼算法 - 遗物)"
	"description"		"[h1]东尼算法 - 遗物 / Anthony Algorithm - Relics[/h1]

每局游戏,用东尼算法从本局种子确定性地生成 60 件遗物,并替换本局全部的遗物掉落.
与原版东尼算法相同的核心机制:[b]触发与效果是独立片段,生成时随机重组[/b] ——
任何合法的触发条件都可能挂上任何合法的效果,包括原版从未存在过的组合.
[i]Every run, deterministically generate 60 relics from the run seed and replace all relic drops. Triggers and effects are independent fragments recombined at generation time - the Anthony algorithm applied to relics.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]它做什么 / What it does[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]60 件生成遗物[/b] - 每局从种子派生,逐槽位重新生成(20 普通 / 21 罕见 / 19 稀有附近分布)
[*][b]条件重组[/b] - 触发片段(回合开始 / 回合结束 / 战斗开始 / 战斗结束 / 战斗胜利 / 进入战斗 / 拾取时 / 打出能力牌 / 敌人死亡 / 获得金币 / 格挡被清空)与效果片段(力量 / 活力 / 荆棘 / 全体易伤 / 格挡 / 回复 / 能量 / 抽牌 / 生命上限 / 金币 / 药水栏位 / 全体伤害)从[b]同一个池子独立采样[/b]
[*][b]双效果遗物[/b] - 约 30% 的遗物携带两个效果,同挂一个触发
[*][b]纯被动遗物[/b] - 少数遗物是首回合抽牌修正(正负都有)
[*][b]中英双语描述[/b] - 每件遗物的名字与描述由片段语义实时渲染
[*][b]确定性[/b] - 同种子 + 同生成设置 = 同一批遗物(逐字节一致);读档/重连恢复同一批
[*][b]负面词条池[/b] - 全游戏遗物(含不参与再生成的先古/事件遗物)的负面词条入池: 诅咒,失去生命上限,失去金币,自伤;均匀抽取,无概率加成.带拾取效果的遗物不可交易,与引擎规则一致
[*][b]先古限制词条[/b] - 先古遗物的限制类负面也入池(禁金币/禁药水/每回合出牌上限/卡牌效果不抽牌/能力牌费+1/敌人入场获得力量),每局按种子抽取其中若干条(实测每局 0-6 条),且必定与引擎原本配对的增益同体出现(例如“禁金币”配“+1 能量”),不会生成只有代价没有收益的遗物
[*][b]纯增益词条[/b] - 先古遗物的纯增益(如 +1 能量)出现率限制在 5%
[/list]

[h2]负面词条 / Downside fragments[/h2]

[i]Downside fragments harvested from every relic in the game - including Ancient and Event relics whose cards never regenerate - join the pool: curses, Max-HP loss, gold loss, self-damage. They draw uniformly, with no appearance bonus. Relics with pickup effects are non-tradable, matching engine rules.[/i]

[h2]先古限制词条 / Ancient restriction fragments[/h2]

[i]The Ancient relics' restriction-type downsides also enter the pool - no gold, no potions, a per-turn card-play cap, card effects stop drawing, Power cards cost 1 more, enemies gain Strength on entry. A run draws a seed-dependent subset of them (measured 0-6 per run), never all six every time. Whenever one is drawn it is forced to appear together with the benefit the engine pairs it with (for example the no-gold restriction ships with +1 Energy), so generation never yields a relic that costs something and grants nothing. Pure Ancient benefits (such as +1 Energy) are gated to a 5% appearance rate.[/i]

[h2]数据忠实度 / Data fidelity[/h2]

原子池从游戏[b]自身的 300 个遗物类[/b]提取,并经过[b]逐条人工审计账本[/b]过滤:
只有证据完整、六项对账(何时/谁/目标/数值/条件/状态)全部通过的片段进入生成池;
提取器无法核实或提取错误的条目(阈值当数值 / 正负号丢失 / 条件反转等)一律[b]拒绝[/b].
已知修复示例:水银玉猫袋(全体 1 易伤)、大蘑菇(首回合少抽 2 张,负号保留)、
弯刀(力量 1)、药水腰带(2 个栏位).
[i]Atoms are extracted from the game's own 300 relic classes and gated by a hand-audited deny-by-default ledger; unverifiable extractions never reach the pool.[/i]

[h2]遗物替换范围 / Relic replacement[/h2]

以下全部遗物来源只出生成遗物:
[list]
[*]战斗奖励 / 精英奖励 / 宝箱 / 商店 / 事件的随机遗物 / 挖掘 / 营火等
[/list]

保持原版不受影响的:
[list]
[*][b]先古之民(Ancient)遗物[/b] - 完全不动
[*]初始遗物 / Neow 遗物 / 事件专属固定遗物(本就不经过奖励池)
[/list]

[h2]游戏内设置 / In-game settings[/h2]

设置 -> 模组设置(专属设置页):
[list]
[*][b]Enabled(总开关)[/b] - 关闭后生成遗物停用,奖励池恢复原版
[*][b]ReplaceVanillaRelics(替换原版遗物)[/b] - 关闭后生成遗物与原版遗物混合掉落
[*]其他 BaseLib 遗物模组的自定义遗物自动保留,无需单独开关
[/list]

[h2]与 怪异炼化 - 遗物 共存 / Coexistence with Qurious Crafting[/h2]

可与 [b]Qurious Crafting - Relics(怪异炼化 - 遗物)[/b] 同装:本模组的替换会保留 BaseLib 自定义遗物,但 Qurious 的掉落池只保留它自己的混沌遗物,双装时实际掉落以 Qurious 为主,组合体验请以实测为准.
[i]Can be installed alongside Qurious Crafting - Relics; note that Qurious's pool replacement keeps only its own chaos relics, so with both installed drops skew toward Qurious. Test your combination.[/i]

[h2]额外词条池与权重 / Extra effect pool and weights[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]额外词条池[/b](默认关):开启后,生成遗物还可能获得从 [b]怪异炼化 - 遗物[/b] 搬来的卡牌级效果 -- 使手牌获得保留 / 奇巧 / 虚无,或为其附上锋利 / 灵巧 / 注能附魔.原版遗物从不做这些事,故默认关闭
[*][b]四个生成权重[/b]:分别为触发词条 / 被动词条 / 增益词条 / 额外池词条,默认均为 100.它们决定各档在遗物池中的[b]占比[/b],因此只有相互[b]比例[/b]有意义(四项同倍缩放不改变结果);100/100/100/100 即默认的 80/15/5 分布.把某一项设为 0 会关闭该档
[*][b]关闭所有负面效果[/b](默认关):开启后生成的遗物不再带有任何负面效果 -- 不会失去生命/生命上限/金币,不会获得诅咒,不会使手牌虚无,也不会出现先古之民的限制类词条. 注意:[b]回合结束不自动丢弃手牌[/b] 不算负面效果,仍可能出现
[*][b]避免无效效果[/b](默认[b]开[/b]):遗物不会再抽到\"在其触发时机根本无法生效\"的效果. 实测修复的缺陷:200 个种子中每局约有 3 件遗物是死效果,例如\"每场战斗结束时获得 14 点格挡\"(战斗已结束,格挡随之清除)或在此处\"获得能量\"(已无回合可用). 另有[b]两类无论开关如何都不会生成[/b]:战斗结束时对敌人造成伤害或减益(此时敌人已全部死亡),以及非战斗状态下需要战斗的效果
[/list]
[i]Extra effect pool (off by default): when on, relics may also roll card-level effects ported from Qurious Crafting - give cards in your hand Retain / Sly / Ethereal, or enchant them with Sharp / Nimble / Imbued. Four weights set each band's share of the relic pool; only the ratio between them matters, and 100/100/100/100 gives the default 80/15/5 split. Setting one to 0 switches that band off.[/i]
[i]Disable all negative effects (off by default): generated relics then carry no downside at all - no losing HP, max HP or gold, no curses, no hand-Ethereal, and none of the Ancient restriction affixes. Note: \"your hand is not discarded at the end of the turn\" is NOT treated as negative and can still appear.[/i]
[i]Prevent ineffective effects (ON by default): relics will no longer roll an effect that could not do anything where it fires. Measured defect this fixes: across 200 seeds roughly 3 relics per run were dead effects, e.g. \"at the end of each combat, gain 14 Block\" (the combat is over and block is cleared) or \"gain Energy\" there (no turn is left to spend it). Two further categories are never generated regardless of the toggle: effects that damage or weaken enemies at combat end (every enemy is already dead), and effects that need a combat when none is running.[/i]

[h2]多人联机 / Multiplayer[/h2]

遗物定义是 (种子 + 生成设置) 的纯函数:同种子 + 同设置,两端生成同一批遗物.
[b]注意[/b]:额外池开关, 四个权重, [b]关闭所有负面效果[/b] 与 [b]避免无效效果[/b] 都[b]参与生成[/b],联机两端必须使用[b]相同取值[/b],否则各自生成不同遗物.
[i]Definitions are a pure function of (run seed + generation settings): same seed and same settings -> both ends regenerate identical relics. The extra-pool toggle, the four weights, \"disable all negative effects\" and \"prevent ineffective effects\" ARE generation inputs, so every player must use the SAME values in multiplayer.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]署名与数据来源 / Attribution[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]机制[/b]:条件与效果独立采样、种子确定性重组,来自 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3786611028]Alriph 的 Auto-Anthonyology(东尼算法)[/url] 的思想重写;本 mod 与其相互独立,不依赖也不重复其数据
[*][b]原子数据[/b]:由本模组工具从《杀戮尖塔 2》自身遗物实现中提取,经人工审计账本过滤
[*][b]生成器 / 宿主 / 渲染[/b]:本仓库独立实现
[/list]

[h2]前置依赖 / Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]必须[/b]:[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3737335127]BaseLib[/url] 3.4.5+
[/list]

[i]工坊版 BaseLib 更新经常落后于官方 GitHub;游戏更新后若 BaseLib 报错,请到 [url=https://github.com/Alchyr/BaseLib-StS2/releases]GitHub Releases[/url] 下载最新版并取消订阅工坊版.[/i]

[h2]控制台验证(可选)/ Console test[/h2]

局内按 ` 打开开发者控制台:
[code]relic add AUTOANTHONYRELICS-ANTHONY_RELIC005[/code] (添加第 6 号槽位生成遗物)"
				"changenote"		"v0.1.9: NEW - three optional generation settings plus per-pool weights. (1) An EXTRA effect pool (off by default) adds 9 effects ported from Qurious Crafting Relics: give cards in your hand Retain / Sly / Ethereal, or enchant them with Sharp / Nimble / Imbued. (2) DISABLE ALL NEGATIVE EFFECTS (off by default) removes every downside from generation - no losing HP, max HP or gold, no curses, no hand-Ethereal, and none of the Ancient restriction affixes. Note that 'your hand is not discarded at the end of the turn' is NOT treated as negative and can still appear. (3) Four generation weights set each band's SHARE of the relic pool, so only the ratio between them matters; 100/100/100/100 gives the default 80/15/5 split, and setting one to 0 switches that band off. (4) PREVENT INEFFECTIVE EFFECTS (ON by default) stops relics from rolling an effect that could not do anything where its trigger fires. Measured defect it fixes: across 200 seeds roughly 3 relics per run were dead effects, e.g. 'at the end of each combat, gain 14 Block' (the combat is over and block is cleared) or 'gain Energy' there (no turn is left to spend it). Two categories are never generated regardless of this toggle: effects that damage or weaken enemies at combat end (every enemy is already dead), and effects that need a combat when none is running. MULTIPLAYER: the toggles and the weights are part of the generation key, so every player must use the same values. A run started on 0.1.8 gets its 60 relics REGENERATED (new names and effects) on first load under 0.1.9 - one-time only, after which the set is stable for that seed. FIX - a config-key collision with Qurious Crafting Relics: the extra-pool toggle was first named EnableExtraPool, which is also one of that mod's pre-rename config keys, and because both mods' config files share a filename (BaseLib derives it from the root namespace, and Qurious was renamed FROM AutoAnthonyRelics) its migration claimed and renamed THIS mod's config, resetting every setting. Both sides are fixed and the renamed key is now EnableExtraEffectPool."
	"publishedfileid"		"3801304033"
}
